OL,3,GNEWSAOmbudsman highlights boy's long
OL,4,Awheelchair wait
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn ombudsman has highlighted how a boy
OL,7,Fwith cerebral palsy was left without a
OL,8,Fsuitable wheelchair for seven months.
OL,10,FElliot, from Hertfordshire, who is now
OL,11,Fsix, fell and injured himself multiple
OL,12,Ftimes and was unable to attend nursery.
OL,14,FHis case has been raised in a report by
OL,15,FPaula Sussex, the public service
OL,16,Fombudsman, who has called for
OL,17,Fimprovements to the safety and
OL,18,Findependence of wheelchair users.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
