OL,3,GNEWSAOmbudsman highlights boy's long
OL,4,Awheelchair wait
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the Department of
OL,7,FHealth and Social Care (DHSC) said it
OL,8,Fwould "carefully consider" the findings
OL,9,Fof the report.
